{"4092940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucky Shot", "steam_appid": 4092940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A flick-shot dopamine machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Shot</strong> is a roguelike mag-builder FPS where precise shooting meets wild buildcrafting. Master different weapons, stack Holos, arrange special bullets, and combine charms, energy drinks, and target upgrades into absurd, run-breaking combos. Land clean shots, grow huge multipliers, and push the score until the run breaks wide open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.poster.avif?t=1787507288\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.webm?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.mp4?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build wild combos. Break the shooting range.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each run around the tools you find. Reach the required score, defeat the bosses, and keep the run alive as every choice changes what your next shot can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 150+ Holos that stack, synergize, and bend the rules in different ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 12 different weapons, each with a unique playstyle that changes how you approach every run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special bullets for your mag that define your build and shape each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ bosses that test both your aim and your build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 16+ charms that stay with you throughout the run and trigger special effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ energy drinks with side effects that can save a run or wreck it completely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special target types that let you influence what spawns next. The range is yours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New stages, new eras, new tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage pays tribute to a different era, with its own visual identity and soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/93bcb8d19ce8da4d8230cd7ae293e927.poster.avif?t=1787507288\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/93bcb8d19ce8da4d8230cd7ae293e927.webm?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/93bcb8d19ce8da4d8230cd7ae293e927.mp4?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy matters as much as aim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not need to be an FPS expert. Lucky Shot is designed for shooter and deckbuilder players alike: strong aim can push a build further, while smart synergies and magazine planning can turn every shot into something spectacular.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/079bf2d1fdfc08e073716168eb04076a.poster.avif?t=1787507288\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/079bf2d1fdfc08e073716168eb04076a.webm?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/079bf2d1fdfc08e073716168eb04076a.mp4?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A flick-shot dopamine machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Shot</strong> is a roguelike mag-builder FPS where precise shooting meets wild buildcrafting. Master different weapons, stack Holos, arrange special bullets, and combine charms, energy drinks, and target upgrades into absurd, run-breaking combos. Land clean shots, grow huge multipliers, and push the score until the run breaks wide open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.poster.avif?t=1787507288\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.webm?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092940/extras/9e5d4442dcf9526dd3fbed53bc04f6f5.mp4?t=1787507288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build wild combos. Break the shooting range.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each run around the tools you find. Reach the required score, defeat the bosses, and keep the run alive as every choice changes what your next shot can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 150+ Holos that stack, synergize, and bend the rules in different ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 12 different weapons, each with a unique playstyle that changes how you approach every run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ Multiple special bullets for your mag that define your build and shape each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 15+ bosses that test both your aim and your build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➤ 16+ charms that stay with you throughout the run and trigger special effects</p><p class=\"bb_para